sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Equipment as Equipment
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Equipment: reviseDetails(name, category, ownership, purchaseValue)
    Note over Equipment: Policies: equipmentRead, equipmentWrite, equipmentExecute
    Note over Equipment: Guards (3)
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[0]: self.registeredAt != null
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[1]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.name
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.category
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.ownership
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.purchaseValue
    Equipment->>EventBus: emit EquipmentDetailsRevised on equipment.details_revised
    Equipment-->>-Client: void